        Root cause:
        The bug appears to be related to improper handling of the core node name within the `preRegister` method of `ZkController`. Specifically, there were redundant calls to retrieve the `CloudDescriptor`, which could lead to inconsistencies or errors if the descriptor was modified elsewhere in the code. Additionally, the lack of a proper check to set the core node name before other operations could result in trying to access a null or uninitialized value, causing exceptions when interacting with Zookeeper's state.

        Commit message:
        SOLR-5510

